% trifecta
%
% The Logical English (for LPS) twin of an Epilog game, written by the Epilog translator
% from trifecta.hrf (kept in sources/): the operations are causal laws, the
% views over the state intensional fluents.
% The scenario is a play EpilogJS made; LPS2's final state of it is checked against EpilogJS's
% (test_epilog.pl).
% Source: the Epilog Games page, http://epilog.stanford.edu/homepage/game.php?game=trifecta
%
% DISCLAIMER. This program was written by a translator from a program of another
% system. It is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
% implied, including any warranty that it is accurate, complete or fit for a
% particular purpose. The translation may be wrong: check it against its source
% before relying on it. It is not legal, tax, insurance, financial or other
% professional advice. Its authors accept no liability for any loss or damage
% arising from its use.

the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 9.

the actions are:
    the move mark with *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as mark.

the fluents are:
    *an index* cell *a second index* with *a thing*; known as cell.
    *a role* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is the col of *a second thing*; known as col.
    *a thing* is a diag; known as diag.
    the move mark with *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_mark.
    open; known as open.
    *a thing* is the row of *a second thing*; known as row.
    *a thing* is a line; known as line.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.

the knowledge base trifecta includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/trifecta.hrf".

the move mark with an index and a second index is legal at a time if
    the index cell the second index with b at the time.

the goal of x is 100 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of x is 0 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 100 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 50 at a time if
    it is not the case that x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

the goal of o is 0 at a time if
    x is a line at the time
    and it is not the case that o is a line at the time.

a thing is the row of a second thing at a time if
    the thing cell 1 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 2 with the second thing at the time
    and the thing cell 3 with the second thing at the time.

a thing is the col of a second thing at a time if
    1 cell the thing with the second thing at the time
    and 2 cell the thing with the second thing at the time
    and 3 cell the thing with the second thing at the time.

a thing is a diag at a time if
    1 cell 1 with the thing at the time
    and 2 cell 2 with the thing at the time
    and 3 cell 3 with the thing at the time.

a thing is a diag at a time if
    1 cell 3 with the thing at the time
    and 2 cell 2 with the thing at the time
    and 3 cell 1 with the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    a second thing is the row of the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    a second thing is the col of the thing at the time.

a thing is a line at a time if
    the thing is a diag at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    x is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    o is a line at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    it is not the case that open at the time.

open at a time if
    an index cell a second index with b at the time.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and a role is a control
then the index cell the second index with the role
    and it is not the case that the index cell the second index with b.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and x is a control
then o is a control
    and it is not the case that x is a control.

when the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and o is a control
then x is a control
    and it is not the case that o is a control.

it must not be true that
    the move mark with an index and a second index is made
    and it is not the case that the move mark with the index and the second index is legal.

initially 1 cell 1 with b
    and 1 cell 2 with b
    and 1 cell 3 with b
    and 2 cell 1 with b
    and 2 cell 2 with b
    and 2 cell 3 with b
    and 3 cell 1 with b
    and 3 cell 2 with b
    and 3 cell 3 with b
    and x is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - control(o)
%   - cell(1,1,x)
%   - cell(1,2,x)
%   - cell(1,3,x)
%   - cell(2,1,b)
%   - cell(2,2,b)
%   - cell(2,3,o)
%   - cell(3,1,x)
%   - cell(3,2,o)
%   - cell(3,3,o)
scenario play is:
    the move mark with 1 and 1 is made from 1 to 2.
    the move mark with 3 and 3 is made from 2 to 3.
    the move mark with 1 and 2 is made from 3 to 4.
    the move mark with 2 and 3 is made from 4 to 5.
    the move mark with 3 and 1 is made from 5 to 6.
    the move mark with 3 and 2 is made from 6 to 7.
    the move mark with 1 and 3 is made from 7 to 8.

